    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808420/extras/b57d87bf477489b29ae1ffde6e2da62e.avif?t=1754855367\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worldspawn isn't a mod or an afterthought. It's a focused platform designed from the ground up for the precision and flow of bhop and surf.\u00a0 Experience the authentic feel you love, rebuilt on a dedicated, modern platform.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peak performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community driven</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808420/extras/27a999744237855b86a6945ef27ef394.avif?t=1754855367\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Massive</strong></i> library of maps including all the classics such as surf_skyword, bh_aztec, bhop_advi,\u00a0kz_adv_cursedjourney, and endless more.\u00a0 Dive into a growing library of community creations, from classic styles to innovative new challenges.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-class support for all the originals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom level editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster load times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better performance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808420/extras/a465b061fdda90f1c5d5137da336c035.avif?t=1754855367\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll stop at nothing to make sure everybody can enjoy bunnyhop and surf without limits, hacks, or workarounds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Android / iOS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mac</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linux</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808420/extras/f357fc4065cd402e4371054c8460369e.avif?t=1754855367\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Discord is where it all happens \u2013 updates, feedback, map sharing, finding players, and direct interaction with the development process.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808420/extras/b57d87bf477489b29ae1ffde6e2da62e.avif?t=1754855367\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worldspawn isn't a mod or an afterthought. It's a focused platform designed from the ground up for the precision and flow of bhop and surf.\u00a0 Experience the authentic feel you love, rebuilt on a dedicated, modern platform.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peak performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community driven</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808420/extras/27a999744237855b86a6945ef27ef394.avif?t=1754855367\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Massive</strong></i> library of maps including all the classics such as surf_skyword, bh_aztec, bhop_advi,\u00a0kz_adv_cursedjourney, and endless more.\u00a0 Dive into a growing library of community creations, from classic styles to innovative new challenges.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-class support for all the originals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom level editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster load times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better performance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808420/extras/a465b061fdda90f1c5d5137da336c035.avif?t=1754855367\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll stop at nothing to make sure everybody can enjoy bunnyhop and surf without limits, hacks, or workarounds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Android / iOS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mac</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linux</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808420/extras/f357fc4065cd402e4371054c8460369e.avif?t=1754855367\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Discord is where it all happens \u2013 updates, feedback, map sharing, finding players, and direct interaction with the development process.</p>",
    "short_description": "An authentic bhop &amp; surf experience honoring all the classic maps and empowering the creation of new experiences. Master momentum on legendary and fresh maps with lightning-fast performance and seamless cross-platform play.",
